      "position": [
        -60,
        -560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Make a Google Sheet with a tab named **Invoices** and paste the header row from `sheet-headers.csv`.\n2. Open **Settings**: sheet URL and your email.\n3. Connect Gmail (trigger and any Gmail node), Google Sheets and OpenAI on the nodes with warnings.\n4. The trigger checks unread mail matching `in:inbox has:attachment (invoice OR receipt OR statement)` every minute. Change that search in **New email** to match your inbox.\n5. Send yourself a test from another address, check the result, then switch to **Active**.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "71f758a9-ab4f-5f35-b419-31a02d3db2d5",
      "name": "Note: setup",
